{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2025,4,2]],"date-time":"2025-04-02T01:31:00Z","timestamp":1743557460361},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"Zain Publications","issue":"12","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["IJCSMC"],"abstract":"<jats:p>This paper is centred on bringing a revolution in the health sector, which is possible with the help of our project \u201cProduct Analysis using Computer Vision\u201d. We as consumers\/customers nowadays purchase food and cosmetic products without knowing and checking the ingredient list. This is because of the lack of clarity about the ingredients mentioned in the product. This problem has to be put on focus as there might be customers who purchase the products which contain the ingredients they are allergic to. To overcome this problem, we have created a website that helps people to understand the ingredient list and then decide whether to purchase or not. With the help of this, we are trying to bring transparency among the health sector and the consumers.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.47760\/ijcsmc.2022.v11i12.004","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2022,12,13]],"date-time":"2022-12-13T11:38:06Z","timestamp":1670931486000},"page":"48-52","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":2,"title":["Product Analysis using Computer Vision"],"prefix":"10.47760","volume":"11","author":[{"given":"Pallavi","family":"Hivarkar","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Varun","family":"Shrivastava","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Pronoy","family":"Bhattacharya","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Sarthak","family":"Jawade","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Adarsh"